- * --- The wedge ----------------------------------------------------------
- *
- * Anthropic-compatible backends (Anthropic, DeepSeek, …) reject a request
- * whose `user[tool_result]` blocks are not at the HEAD of the user message
- * immediately following the `model[tool_use]` they answer:
